# Project core

This repo is an in-memory Graph-of-Thought engine (`got/`), not a multi-agent runtime.

- Before nontrivial edits, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture/overview.md`.
- Workflow: Understand → Scope → Plan → Implement → Verify → Report.
- Trust source under `got/` over `docs/planning/` and over Cursor `*-agent.mdc` personas.
- Implemented path: `got/api` → `got/application` → `got/domain`.
- Empty / unwired: `got/domain/ports/`, `got/infrastructure/`, `got/interface/`, `merge_nodes.py`.
- `got/domain/reasoning` stays deterministic and LLM-free.
- Verify with `uv run pytest` and `uv run ruff check got examples` when the change can break behavior or style. Do not claim checks you did not run. CI still uses `uv run ruff got examples`, which Ruff 0.14.x rejects.
- Do not commit `.env` or API keys. LLM unit tests must stub `OpenRouterClient`.
